{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a travel photographer and have been invited to a castle for a photo gig. But all of a sudden you are knocked out, and you wake up in the middle of the night. You are clearly not alone. What is going on? How can you find your way out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>- Find a way out of the castle by finding and following clues. Traverse the environment by walking, running, and jumping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Uncover the story of the castle by looking at and interacting with objects. Pick up the objects that you need to progress through the castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Be wary of ghostly activity and walk around with care. React fast to avoid ghostly activity, don't get too hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Find bonus items by exploring the castle; They give a glimpse into the castle's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3155660?t=1738695236","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155660/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738695236","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155660/b9cc328bdda8349ba92f04cc4f453416a17b9ddd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738695236","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155660/b9cc328bdda8349ba92f04cc4f453416a17b9ddd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738695236","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a travel photographer and have been invited to a castle for a photo gig. But all of a sudden you are knocked out, and you wake up in the middle of the night. You are clearly not alone. What is going on? How can you find your way out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>- Find a way out of the castle by finding and following clues. Traverse the environment by walking, running, and jumping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Uncover the story of the castle by looking at and interacting with objects. Pick up the objects that you need to progress through the castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Be wary of ghostly activity and walk around with care. React fast to avoid ghostly activity, don't get too hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Find bonus items by exploring the castle; They give a glimpse into the castle's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["paulchristianindiegame.com"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155660/header.jpg?t=1738695236","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257090107,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090107/movie480.mp4?t=1737197031","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090107/movie_max.mp4?t=1737197031"},"name":"You need light. But light means you are not alone.","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257090107/a80525ec0fae582249feed22d1e419cbaf78da9f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1737197031","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090107/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1737197031","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090107/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1737197031"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257080004,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257080004/movie480.mp4?t=1733656375","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257080004/movie_max.mp4?t=1733656375"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257080004/dcf2cf2f6dc126ef